<title>COSTA RICA: Costa Rica May inflation rate rises 0.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica May inflation rate rises 0.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Costa Rica 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica's inflation rate rose 0.51 percent in May, down from the 1.34 percent increase registered in April, the Economics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Among the largest increases were seen in food products.</p>
<p>Accumulated inflation from Janaury to May was 5.74 percnt, slightly higher than in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--Costa Rica bureau +506 224-2949))</p>
